  - id: Viz_15
    note_tile:
      html_parsed_string: |-
        <p><strong>Root Cause Analysis</strong></p>
        <p><em>What's driving policy breaches?</em></p>
        <p>Dig into the underlying factors behind non-compliant bookings — from <strong>lead times</strong> and <strong>booking channels</strong> to <strong>cabin class</strong> selections and <strong>seniority-level</strong> patterns. Identify where and why violations concentrate to target corrective action.</p>
  - id: Viz_16
    note_tile:
      html_parsed_string: |-
        <p><strong>Financial Impact &amp; Opportunities</strong></p>
        <p><em>Quantifying the cost of non-compliance and uncovering savings.</em></p>
        <p>This section maps compliance gaps to their financial consequences—penalties, lost revenue, and operational inefficiencies. Use these visuals to pinpoint high-impact areas where corrective action yields the greatest savings recovery.</p>
        <ul>
        <li>Cost breakdown by violation category</li>
        <li>Recovery potential by business unit</li>
        <li>Trend analysis of penalty exposure</li>
        </ul>
